  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The first conception of the idea for this edition was the exhibition entitled Sistema de Riego (Watering System) which was held in December, 2006 in the city of Campeche.... The main idea of the project consisted of planning, designing and building a mechanism which would work as a system to carry water to certain places of the garden inside the building. This watering system was built with structures based on recycled materials, wood, pipes, buckets, hoses and bottles among other objects.... The edition gathers in a book, a series of photographs and texts related to this intervention."--MoNDAo Corp. web site (viewed Nov. 2, 2009).</subfield>
  </datafield>
